[SIZE=5][COLOR=#FF6600][B]🎃 Halloween Plugin v3.0.8 - Grave Customization Update![/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Release Date:[/B][/COLOR] October 20, 2025
[COLOR=#FF6600][B]Type:[/B][/COLOR] Content expansion - messages customization

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#CC3300] New Feature[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[COLOR=#009900][B]v3.0.8 - Grave Event Message Customization[/B][/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*][B]NEW:[/B] All grave event messages now customizable in messages.yml
[*][B]TRANSLATABLE:[/B] Wave announcements, timeouts, completions - fully customizable
[*][B]FLEXIBLE:[/B] Server admins can now translate grave messages to any language
[*][B]NO CONFIG CHANGES:[/B] Drop-in upgrade, messages.yml is smart-merged
[*][B]ENHANCED:[/B] Multiple message variations for each event type for variety
[/LIST]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#0066CC] Translation Example[/COLOR][/SIZE]

Easily translate grave messages to your language:

[CODE]
# In messages.yml
graveWaveStart:
  - "§c§l⚔ WAVE %WAVE%/%TOTAL_WAVES% §7spawned!"  # Default English
  - "§c§l⚔ VAGUE %WAVE%/%TOTAL_WAVES% §7générée!" # French
  - "§c§l⚔ WELLE %WAVE%/%TOTAL_WAVES% §7gestartet!" # German

graveAllWavesDefeated:
  - "§a§l✔ All waves defeated! Rewards await..."  # English
  - "§a§l✔ Todas las olas derrotadas! Recompensas esperan..." # Spanish
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600] Configuration[/COLOR][/SIZE]

No config changes needed! Simply:
1. Update to v3.0.8
2. messages.yml is smart-merged with new grave messages
3. Your existing messages are preserved
4. New grave messages use sensible defaults
5. Customize as needed!

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#FF6600] Installation[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.7.jar[/FONT] with [FONT=courier]halloween-plugin-3.0.8.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start your server
[*]Messages.yml will auto-merge with new grave messages
[*]No config.yml changes 
[/LIST]

[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Compatibility:[/B][/COLOR] v3.0.7 → v3.0.8 = No migration (fully compatible)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Minecraft:[/B][/COLOR] 1.21.1+ (Paper/Purpur recommended)
[COLOR=#CC6600][B]Java:[/B][/COLOR] 17+

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#9900CC] What This Means[/COLOR][/SIZE]

Server admins now have complete control over all grave event messages:
[LIST]
[*]Translate to any language
[*]Customize for your server theme
[*]Add multiple variations for randomness
[*]Keep existing messages while adding new ones
[*]Full flexibility for storytelling
[/LIST]



